        <mxCell id="a4s-content2" value="ML模型 (XGBoost/Isolation Forest) | Graph分析 (Neo4j/TigerGraph)&#xa;LLM大模型 (GPT-4/Claude) | NER/NLP | RAG 检索增强" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
